Ported into this repository
---------------------------

MvaveFM1Unbricker, https://github.com/Quixotic7/MvaveFM1Unbricker (in the firmware)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Michael P Jones. MIT License (text below).
  Ported: the softkey handshake (lib/fm1_loader/src/softkey.*), the .fwsc/UFW
  package parsing (lib/fm1_loader/src/package.*, tools/fm1lib.py,
  tools/catalog_dedupe.py), part of lib/fm1_loader/src/crypto.*, and the test
  mock (tests/support/mock_rom.*).
  The Unbricker's package parsing, CRC and header cipher say they are ports of
  firmware/src/ota.c in Felucca (https://github.com/hugelton/Felucca), which
  derives from M-VAVE's fm1_open; both are GPL-3.0. See
  docs/public-release-audit.md, "Licenses". Outrigger as a whole is GPL-3.0,
  which settles that question.

jl-uboot-tool, https://github.com/kagaimiq/jl-uboot-tool (in the firmware)
  Copyright (c) 2023 Andrey Grigoryev (kagaimiq). MIT License (text below).
  Ported: the ROM-boot command layouts (lib/fm1_loader/src/rom.*) and the
  MengLi cipher and CRC (lib/fm1_loader/src/crypto.*).


